# Keep the build context to what the image actually runs.
#
# `data/` matters most: it is where a locally-run keeper puts its key, and copying it into a
# build context is how a mnemonic ends up baked into a published image layer.
data/
ci-data/
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git/
.github/
.claude/
test/
zimaos/
*.md
*.tsbuildinfo
